1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:05,302
In every bazaar in Pakistan, small clothing sellers have good stock.

2
00:00:05,652 --> 00:00:12,618
But getting one shirt online means photos, background removal, captions, sizes and prices.

3
00:00:12,968 --> 00:00:15,789
Hours of work, for every single item.

4
00:00:17,190 --> 00:00:19,802
This is Vestire AI Listing Studio.

5
00:00:20,152 --> 00:00:22,321
One photo. A full listing.

6
00:00:23,720 --> 00:00:27,191
The seller adds one photo, straight from the shop counter.

7
00:00:27,541 --> 00:00:31,266
No need to clean the background. Just tap the garment.

8
00:00:32,670 --> 00:00:33,692
Tap Generate.

9
00:00:34,042 --> 00:00:37,592
Meta's Segment Anything model, in its compressed SlimSAM

10
00:00:37,592 --> 00:00:41,078
version, cuts the garment out right inside the browser.

11
00:00:41,428 --> 00:00:45,656
At the same time, Meta Llama 4 Scout, an open-weights model,

12
00:00:45,656 --> 00:00:48,615
looks at the photo and writes the listing.

13
00:00:48,965 --> 00:00:53,737
On this live run, the whole pipeline finished in under twenty seconds.

14
00:00:55,140 --> 00:01:00,457
Back comes a clean cut-out, a white studio shot, and a flat-lay scene.

15
00:01:00,807 --> 00:01:04,720
All of them use the seller's real garment, not an AI copy.

16
00:01:05,070 --> 00:01:07,729
Type a colour, and you get a colour preview too.

17
00:01:09,130 --> 00:01:10,628
Everything is editable.

18
00:01:10,978 --> 00:01:14,470
If a risky claim like "original" slips into the title,

19
00:01:14,470 --> 00:01:17,445
the app flags it before anything is published.

20
00:01:17,795 --> 00:01:21,185
Descriptions in English and Roman Urdu, captions,

21
00:01:21,185 --> 00:01:24,575
hashtags, and a size chart are all ready to edit.

22
00:01:24,925 --> 00:01:28,894
And the price is only a suggestion. The seller decides.

23
00:01:30,290 --> 00:01:35,259
Share it to WhatsApp in one tap, or download the full listing pack.

24
00:01:35,609 --> 00:01:41,983
Images, captions, listing data, and a CSV file, ready for the store's import.

25
00:01:43,380 --> 00:01:48,396
For Vestire stores, there is also an optional Send to Vestire setting.

26
00:01:48,746 --> 00:01:52,265
It is off by default, and it creates the product as a

27
00:01:52,265 --> 00:01:56,049
hidden draft, so the owner checks it before it goes live.

28
00:01:57,450 --> 00:02:01,303
Hours of work, in about a minute. Free to use.

29
00:02:01,653 --> 00:02:07,433
Vestire AI Listing Studio. Built with Meta Llama 4 Scout and Segment Anything.

